CB011039_fallback_after_no_mplane_connectivity
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of the test case is to check RFSW fallback after no m-plane connectivity.
    ...  Optical switch and LMI Light board are required for this test case, they should be configured for tested RMOD.
    ...  All RMOD's optical links with optcal switch channels must be defined in init file.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD config id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param str sw_download_path: (Optional) : absolute directory path to download sw package, defaults to /home/ute
    ...  :param str back_to_basic_sw: (Optional) : If set to False then basic sw package is not loaded to BTS
    ...                                            in test teardown. Defaults to True.

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${sw_download_path}=/home/ute
    ...            ${back_to_basic_sw}=${True}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${running_build_name_before_update}                     Get Current Running Build Name from RMOD via LMI Light
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_optical_links_config}                            Get Optical Links Config for RMOD
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}

    Update SW Package and Disable Optical Links for RMOD and Check Statuses of BTS Components
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     rmod_optical_links_config=${rmod_optical_links_config}
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Log Actual Time
    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting up to 240 minutes for RFSW fallback on disabled RMOD...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             240min
    ...                                                     60min
    ...                                                     Check if Current Running Build Name is The Same as Expected
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     expected_build_name=${running_build_name_before_update}
    Robot Log Result                                        RFSW fallback has been performed successfully on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Enabling all optical links for RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    Enable All Optical links for RMOD                       rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    Robot Log Result                                        All optical links for RMOD-${rmod_id} have been enabled.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Alarms.Allow Alarm                                      fault_id=1850

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for RMOD-${rmod_id} startup...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 300sec
    ...                                                     10sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     status_variant=offline
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for active alarm FID:1850
    ${is_1850_alarm_active}                                 Wait for active alarm
    ...                                                     fault_id=1850
    ...                                                     timeout=180
    Should be True                                          ${is_1850_alarm_active}

    Perform Site Reset And Wait On OnAir                    bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Disallow Alarm                                   fault_id=10
    ...                                                     fault_name=No connection to unit
    Alarms.Disallow Alarm                                   fault_id=1850
    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms

    [Teardown]                                              Lost mPlane Connectivity Teardown
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     rmod_optical_links_config=${rmod_optical_links_config}
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     back_to_basic_sw=${back_to_basic_sw}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

